aragraph; its internal alignment does not create paragraph breaks."}]}, "stem": "musaf_repetition_kesod_siach", "title": {"en": "According to the mystic utterance", "he": "כסוד שיח"}, "urn": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/naaritzekha_venaqdishkha_kesod"}, "variants": []}
